OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool Street remains busiest
OL,4,Astation in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe estimated number between April 2025
OL,7,Fand March 2026 was 102.7 million,
OL,8,Fcompared with 98 million the year
OL,9,Fbefore. The large increase in
OL,10,Fpassengers has been put down to the
OL,11,Fincreased use of the Elizabeth line
OL,12,Fwhich opened in 2022.
OL,14,FThe Elizabeth line serves five of the
OL,15,FUK's busiest stations - Liverpool
OL,16,FStreet, Paddington, Tottenham Court
OL,17,FRoad, Farringdon and Bond Street.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
